# Imported INSIDE the {$SITE_DOMAIN} site block, production only.
#
# Mail lives at mail.tatvaos.com and nowhere else. Both hostnames are front
# doors onto the same web container, so without this rule every product
# answers on every host — core.tatvaos.com/mail/inbox served a full inbox,
# which blurs the one thing the separate domain exists to say. The redirect
# keeps the path, so a deep link to a message survives the hop, and the auth
# cookie has Domain=.tatvaos.com so the session survives it too.
@mailpaths path /mail /mail/*
redir @mailpaths https://{$MAIL_DOMAIN}{uri}
